exit: 0
stdout:
{"reference":["  [--resources TEXT] [--label key=value ...] [--adapter none|kind|k3d|compose]","  [--file PATH (required for compose)] [--quiet | -q] [--axi | --json]","Owner defaults to DIBS_OWNER, then pid:\u003cparent-pid\u003e. pid and session pin","process start time; session:\u003cholder-pid\u003e follows a session-holding process,","not a Unix SID. heartbeat:\u003cpath\u003e must already be a fresh regular file.","kind and k3d create uniquely named clusters; kind uses a private kubeconfig.","compose creates","a uniquely named project with a durable resolved config. none records metadata","only and performs no external cleanup. up is an alias.","Examples:","  dibs create --owner pid:1234 --ttl 2h --resources '2 CPUs, test lab'","  dibs create --adapter kind --owner session:1234 --ttl 1h","  dibs create --adapter compose --file compose.yaml --label task=lab","","Touch heartbeat files at most every staleness/3. Extend a lease at the latest","when one third of its TTL remains. Owner death OR expiry makes a lease","reclaimable: a live owner missing either cadence loses its resources.","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;","75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child","was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait","failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.","76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).","Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure."],"usage":"dibs create [--owner KIND:ID] [--ttl 8h] [--stale 15m]"}
